  "note": "Needs SOCIAL_FRIENDS_ENABLED=true on the server, and GAMES_DECK (any deck of the signed-in account). Opens the form, searches the catalog and seats two commanders; it logs nothing (no Save press). Friends off: the row is absent, which the component tests hold. The held pod's line (a press on a held size) is drawn by the component tests: Playwright will not click an aria-disabled control.",
